  "content_id": "16136206",
  "title": "Axelar AXL Network Fees",
  "description": "Axelar (AXL) Network – Cross-Chain Communication Made Easy\nAxelar enables direct communication and asset movement across different blockch...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ6EQB5YGZHKF8ZZ0PTHBE7\">Axelar (AXL) Network – Cross-Chain Communication Made Easy</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Axelar enables direct communication and asset movement across different blockchains, making it easy to bridge assets safely.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6EQB5SK715V7KJ79WE96G\">How AXL Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas fee</b> based on <b>transaction size</b> and <b>cross-chain complexity</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Paid in <b>AXL tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge dynamically estimates fees based on current Axelar network conditions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6EQB5QP0M5X4NENBH3GFQ\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest bridging and transfer</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Best balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Slower, more economical</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Advanced control over fees</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6EQB5VPW1SVWXDD9DFF63\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.10 to $0.50 USD</b> depending on the type of cross-chain transfer.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6EQB5B49H4DNNFP98T0J0\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Cross-chain transfers can be tricky, but Axelar keeps it streamlined. Edge Wallet ensures your fees stay predictable and your assets move quickly across different blockchains.</p>",
